    "en": "Yes, as the parent and legal guardian, you can request and collect your minor son's birth certificate without him being present. Please come to the civil status (état civil) office with your own ID and the family record book (livret de famille) or your child's civil status details. The child does not need to be present for this procedure."
  }
}
```

